summary:
  After a restart the face is back in the popup although it was left in its window.

history:
  The window is plasmashell's and goes down with it. The config key, read
  once at start, is the only thing that brings the face back to it after a
  restart or a login.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PlayerWindow.qml

find:
      Component.onCompleted: detached = !!cfg && cfg.detached === true

replace:
      Component.onCompleted: detached = false

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_playerwindow.qml::test_a_face_that_was_in_the_window_is_there_again_after_a_start.
